    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nI don't think this is a good addition to 'mini.operators' for at least these reasons:\r\n- Main advantage of having whole operator instead of just acting on visual selection is to enable dot-repeatability. I don't think that searching over same textobject repeatedly is a frequent enough use case to encourage creation of a separate operator.\r\n- I'd say that searching using external `grep` program is more focus for 'mini.pick' / Telescope / fzf-lua / ... . As it provides more possibilities for extra filtering of results.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
